  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You can use your shell offensively as well as defensively, learning a technique where you can run, slip inside your shell and throttle the enemies you pass by. The number of actions you spend determines its effects:</span></p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1 </span>You Shove with your shell, even if both your hands are not free.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span class=\"action-glyph\">2 </span>You can Stride before you Shove and gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Shove attempt as the weight of your shell assists your efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><span class=\"action-glyph\">3 </span>You can Stride up to double your speed. If you spend 3 actions, you can make a Shove attempt against any creature you move adjacently to. You increase your multi-attack penalty only after you have made your Shove attempts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"> If you have the Teratoan Shield feat, you can Strike with your shell instead of Shoving, but if you use 3 actions you increase your multi-attack penalty normally. A creature you critically hit benefits from your Shield critical specialization.</span></p>"
    },
